      "language": "english",
      "review": "Good game. For newcomers, of this version please, please consider:\n1. Collect and save at least 1 of each insects, fishes, forageable items and mineable items you find in the mines. Do not sell them or put in the museum unless you have an extra of each.\n2. IMPORTANT: Give Eiland and Juniper your attention even if you're not interested in them. Make sure to at least talk to them regularly and give them a present. Try your best to put them as close to 8 hearts if possible while playing the game.\n\nYou'll thank me once the gears in your head spin and understand WHY I'm telling you this.\nI'm not go…",
