      "language": "english",
      "review": "I don't write many reviews, in fact this is my second one ever, but I have to write a review for this gem of a game. As you can tell by my playtime, I love this game. I have 700 hours in Stardew, and I always tell people that if they like Stardew, they'll like this game even more (unfortunately most of my friends have Macs, which can't run this game yet). I played this game and as much as I love Stardew, the amount of QoL features in Mistria make it hard to go back (you can jump and swim! and you are so speedy!). Even beyond that, Mistria just feels so much more alive. There is heart and soul …",
      "timestamp_created": 1778879321,
      "timestamp_updated": 1778879321,
      "voted_up": true,
      "votes_up": 23,
      "votes_funny": 0,
      "weighted_vote_score": "0.692245900630950928",
